mapping "W5234.1" source="W5234" target="54719000" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target quality=100 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W5234 SNOMED CT 54719000 is a Swedish SE extension of ICD-10 W52 (Crushed, pushed or stepped
        on by crowd or human stampede) further qualified by location (sports facility) and activity
        (vital activities such as rest, sleep, meals, personal hygiene). Target SNOMED CT 4184610
        (concept_code 54719000), the crosswalk-verified standard target for ICD-10 W52 (ICD10
        concepts.tdl concept_id 45756303 SNOMED CT 54719000 4184610 in relationships.tdl). The target fully
        subsumes every clinical meaning of the source — the location/activity qualifiers are
        administrative context, not a distinct clinical disorder — so broader is the correct kind.
        Confidence (high): verified crosswalk at the parent W52 level, one-level breadth mismatch from
        the SE extension; the parent-of-parent relation is direct and well-understood.
        """
}
